            "text": "{\n  \"judgments\": [\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0001\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F000:F004\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposal modifies the summary to require that inspections under item (II) occur 'not more than once during any 12-month period'. In the source text, item (I) ('not more than once during any 12-month period') and item (II) ('at any time with respect to records relating to a firearm involved in a criminal investigation that is traced to the licensee') are disjunctive alternatives joined by 'or'. Merging the 12-month frequency limit into subclause (II) contradicts the statutory provision allowing inspection 'at any time'.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"proposal_id\": \"P0002\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\"F000\"],\n      \"rationale\": \"The proposed edit only populates the optional action and action_quote fields where the existing draft summary already fully conveys the inspection authority. Filling empty optional action fields alone does not address a defect or add necessary meaning, and is therefore unsupported.\",\n      \"verdict\": \"unsupported\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
